### 1. POST tạo user hợp lệ (Kỳ vọng: 201, body có id, username, role; KHÔNG có password/hash)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "minh",
  "password": "secret123",
  "role": 1
}

### 2. POST cùng username lần 2 (Kỳ vọng: 409 Conflict)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "minh",
  "password": "secret123",
  "role": 1
}

### 3. POST password < 8 ký tự (Kỳ vọng: 422 Unprocessable Entity)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user_short_pass",
  "password": "123",
  "role": 1
}

### 4. POST role dạng chuỗi (Kỳ vọng: 422 Unprocessable Entity)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin_test",
  "password": "secret123",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 5. POST role = 2 (Kỳ vọng: 201 Created)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user2",
  "password": "secret123",
  "role": 2
}

### 6. POST thiếu role -> mặc định role = 1 (Kỳ vọng: 201 Created, role: 1)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user_default_role",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### 7. GET danh sách users (Kỳ vọng: 200 OK, danh sách không có hash)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users

### 8. GET user theo ID đúng (Kỳ vọng: 200 OK)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users/1

### 9. GET user theo ID sai (Kỳ vọng: 404 Not Found)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users/99999

### 10. PUT username + role, không gửi password (Kỳ vọng: 200 OK)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "minh_updated",
  "role": 0
}

### 11. PUT username trùng với user khác (Kỳ vọng: 409 Conflict)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user2",
  "role": 1
}

### 12. DELETE user (Kỳ vọng: 204 No Content)
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users/1

### 13. GET lại ID vừa xóa để xác nhận (Kỳ vọng: 404 Not Found)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users/1